# NOTE: public/robots/ is deliberately NOT ignored. The URDF meshes are fetched
# at runtime, so leaving them out of the repo deploys an app that sits on the
# splash screen forever — which is exactly what happened on the first Vercel
# deploy.

# Source footage and pipeline intermediates. The Apollo reel alone is 102 MB —
# past GitHub's hard 100 MB per-file limit — and none of it is source: it is
# re-downloadable from archive.org and regenerated by the pipeline.
pipeline/footage/
pipeline/out/
